"PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to generate new terms for your "
"content using the OpenAI, IBM Watson, Dandelion and Open Calais services. "
"These services can analyze your content and add new terms."
msgstr ""
"PublishPress Taxonomies Pro vam omogoča, da ustvarite nove izraze za vašo "
"vsebino z uporabo storitev OpenAI, IBM Watson, Dandelion in Open Calais. Te "
"storitve lahko analizirajo vašo vsebino in dodajo nove izraze."

#: includes-core/TaxopressCoreAdmin.php:486
msgid "Additional taxonomies"
msgstr "Dodatne taksonomije"

#: includes-core/TaxopressCoreAdmin.php:496
msgid "Select additional taxonomies..."
msgstr "Izberite dodatne taksonomije..."

#: includes-core/TaxopressCoreAdmin.php:507
msgid ""
"Upgrade to PublishPress Taxonomies Pro to generate separate terms for "
"multiple taxonomies in one OpenAI request."
msgstr ""
"Nadgradite na PublishPress Taxonomies Pro, da generirate ločene pogoje za "
"več taksonomij v eni OpenAI zahtevi."

#: includes-core/TaxopressCoreAdmin.php:512
msgid "Generate separate terms for multiple taxonomies in one OpenAI request."
msgstr "Generirajte ločene pogoje za več taksonomij v eni OpenAI zahtevi."

#: includes-core/TaxopressCoreAdmin.php:544
msgid ""
"PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to suggest new terms for your "
"content using the OpenAI, IBM Watson, Dandelion and Open Calais services. "
"These services can analyze your content and suggest new terms."
msgstr ""
"PublishPress Taxonomies Pro vam omogoča, da predlagate nove izraze za vašo "
"vsebino z uporabo storitev OpenAI, IBM Watson, Dandelion in Open Calais. Te "
"storitve lahko analizirajo vašo vsebino in predlagajo nove izraze."

#: includes-core/TaxopressCoreAdmin.php:563
msgid "Add Custom Elements"
msgstr "Dodajanje prilagojenih elementov"

#: includes-core/TaxopressCoreAdmin.php:568
msgid ""
"PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you complete control over where Auto "
"Links are added. You can choose to skip any HTML elements that appear in "
"your content."
msgstr ""
"PublishPress Taxonomies Pro vam omogoča popoln nadzor nad tem, kje so "
"dodane avtomatske povezave. Izbirate lahko, da preskočite vse HTML "
"elemente, ki se pojavijo v vaši vsebini."

#: includes-core/TaxopressCoreAdmin.php:587
msgid "Use Regular Expressions to modify Auto Terms"
msgstr "Uporabite regularne izraze za spreminjanje avtomatskih izrazov"

#: includes-core/TaxopressCoreAdmin.php:592
msgid ""
"PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to change how Auto Terms analyzes "
"your posts. You will need to know how to write Regular Expressions to use "
"this feature."
msgstr ""
"PublishPress Taxonomies Pro vam omogoča, da spremenite, kako avtomatski "
"izrazi analizirajo vaše objave. Potrebovali boste znanje o pisanju "
"regularnih izrazov, da boste lahko uporabljali to funkcijo."

#: includes-core/TaxopressCoreAdmin.php:614
msgid ""
"This feature allows you to connect terms. When the main term or any of "
"these terms are added to the post, all the other terms will be added also."
msgstr ""
"Ta funkcija vam omogoča povezovanje izrazov. Ko je glavni izraz ali kateri "
"koli od teh izrazov dodan objavi, bodo vsi drugi izrazi prav tako dodani."

#: includes-core/TaxopressCoreAdmin.php:634
msgid "Linked Terms Feature"
msgstr "Funkcija povezanih izrazov"

#: includes-core/TaxopressCoreAdmin.php:638
msgid ""
"PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to create powerful connections "
"between your terms. When one term is added to a post, its linked terms can "
"be automatically added too. This helps maintain consistent organization "
"across your content."
msgstr ""
"PublishPress Taxonomies Pro vam omogoča, da ustvarite močne povezave med "
"vašimi izrazi. Ko je en izraz dodan objavi, se lahko njegovi povezani "
"izrazi prav tako samodejno dodajo. To pomaga ohranjati dosledno "
"organizacijo vaše vsebine."

#: includes-core/TaxopressCoreAdmin.php:656
msgid ""
"This feature allows you to associate additional words with each term. For "
"example, \"website\" can have synonyms such as \"websites\", \"web site\", "
"and \"web pages\"."
msgstr ""
"Ta funkcija vam omogoča, da povežete dodatne besede z vsakim izrazom. Na "
"primer, \"spletna stran\" ima lahko sopomenke, kot so \"spletne strani\", "
"\"spletna stran\" in \"spletne strani\"."

#: includes-core/TaxopressCoreAdmin.php:672
msgid "Synonyms Terms Feature"
msgstr "Funkcija sopomenk"

#: includes-core/TaxopressCoreAdmin.php:676
msgid ""
"PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to have multiple words associated "
"with a single term. If PublishPress Taxonomies scans your content and finds "
"a synonym, it will act as if it has found the main term."
msgstr ""
"PublishPress Taxonomies Pro vam omogoča, da imate več besed povezanih z "
"enim izrazom. Če PublishPress Taxonomies pregleda vašo vsebino in najde "
"sopomenko, se bo obnašal, kot da je našel glavni izraz."

#: includes-core/TaxopressCoreAdmin.php:696
